(program [(function decl "updateClock" [] (block [(var const [(declarator now (new Date))]) (var const [(declarator hours (call (member (call String [(call (member now getHours))]) padStart) [2 "0"]))]) (var const [(declarator minutes (call (member (call String [(call (member now getMinutes))]) padStart) [2 "0"]))]) (var const [(declarator timeString (template ["" hours ":" minutes ""]))]) (var const [(declarator days (array ["Niedziela" "Poniedziałek" "Wtorek" "Środa" "Czwartek" "Piątek" "Sobota"]))]) (var const [(declarator months (array ["Sty" "Lut" "Mar" "Kwi" "Maj" "Cze" "Lip" "Sie" "Wrz" "Paź" "Lis" "Gru"]))]) (var const [(declarator dayName (member computed days (call (member now getDay))))]) (var const [(declarator dayNum (call (member now getDate)))]) (var const [(declarator monthName (member computed months (call (member now getMonth))))]) (var const [(declarator dateString (template ["" dayName ", " dayNum " " monthName ""]))]) (expression (assign = (member (call (member document getElementById) ["clock"]) innerText) timeString)) (expression (assign = (member (call (member document getElementById) ["widget-time"]) innerText) timeString)) (expression (assign = (member (call (member document getElementById) ["widget-date"]) innerText) dateString))])) (expression (call updateClock)) (expression (call setInterval [updateClock 10000])) (var const [(declarator homeScreen (call (member document getElementById) ["home-screen"]))]) (var let [(declarator currentApp null)]) (function decl "openApp" [appId] (block [(var const [(declarator app (call (member document getElementById) [appId]))]) (if app (block [(expression (call (member (member app classList) add) ["active"])) (expression (assign = (member (member homeScreen style) opacity) "0.3")) (expression (assign = (member (member homeScreen style) transform) "scale(0.95)")) (expression (assign = currentApp app))]))])) (function decl "closeApp" [] (block [(if currentApp (block [(expression (call (member (member cur